## hrx-loom-library (ROCm/hrx-loom-library), tag v0.2.0, commit 1fd6bd23279e1f77b3d6b8149ef6d03b27158e8a

The tag matches the installed SDK (hrx-loom 0.2.0). The library main branch (cb9ae9e, 2026-11-20) splits these files differently and its `publish.cxx` needs a newer `loomcxx` than the SDK ships, so main is not used.

| Copy | Source path in the library | Edits |
|---|---|---|
| `program/lib/vendor/epoch.loom` | `program/text/qwen3_8/epoch.loom` | `qwen38` renamed to `inkling`; contains encode_state, encode_epoch, publish_epoch, step, epoch |
| `program/lib/vendor/storage.loom` | `program/text/qwen3_8/storage.loom` | `qwen38` renamed to `inkling` |
| `program/lib/vendor/packet.loom` | `motif/sequence/qwen3_8/packet.loom` | `qwen38` renamed to `inkling` |
| `program/lib/vendor/feedback.loom` | `motif/sequence/qwen3_8/feedback.loom` | `qwen38` renamed to `inkling` |
| `program/lib/vendor/span.loom` | `motif/sequence/qwen3_8/span.loom` | `qwen38` renamed to `inkling` |
| `program/lib/vendor/q8_0.loom` | `motif/format/ggml/q8_0.loom` | none |
| `program/lib/vendor/sampling.loom` | `motif/tensor/sampling.loom` | none |
| `program/lib/vendor/random.loom` | `motif/tensor/random.loom` | none |

Not vendored: the library `encode.loom`, `publish.cxx`, `epoch_target.loom` and `speculation.loom` exist only on main. `program/lib/media_stub.loom` is our own stub of the two media functions that `epoch.loom` declares (`encode_media_plan`, `publish_media_positions`).

`attn_matrix.loom` (`program/lib/inkling/`) is adapted from `hrx-loom-library/motif/tensor/matrix.loom`.

